<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="Customer">
  <data key="d0">Customer</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">An individual who uses banking services provided by the bank, including depositors, nominees, and legal heirs.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual who interacts with the bank and receives services related to deposit accounts and associated rights.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual who uses the services offered by a bank.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual or entity who uses services or products provided by a bank.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-574eef8b2a231a2171cb4eadad4c29e5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787229354</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Customer</data>
</node>
<node id="Banking Regulation Act, 1949">
  <data key="d0">Banking Regulation Act, 1949</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Banking Regulation Act, 1949 is a legislative framework in India that governs the regulation and conduct of banking institutions, ensuring the protection of depositors' interests.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reserve Bank of India">
  <data key="d0">Reserve Bank of India</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Reserve Bank of India is the central banking institution of India, responsible for regulating the country's monetary policy and overseeing financial systems, including issuing directives on interest rates for deposits.&lt;SEP&gt;The central banking institution of India, responsible for regulating the country's monetary policy and financial system.&lt;SEP&gt;The central banking institution of India providing regulations and oversight for banking operations including complaint redressal mechanisms.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Unity Small Finance Bank Limited">
  <data key="d0">Unity Small Finance Bank Limited</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Unity Small Finance Bank Limited is a financial institution that formulates various deposit products in accordance with guidelines issued by the Reserve Bank of India and operates deposit accounts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Depositors">
  <data key="d0">Depositors</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Depositors are individuals who place their money into deposit accounts at banks, making them major stakeholders in the banking system and subjects of regulatory considerations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Financial System">
  <data key="d0">Financial System</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The financial system encompasses the set of institutions, markets, and instruments that facilitate the flow of funds and the allocation of resources in an economy.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Deposit Products">
  <data key="d0">Deposit Products</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Deposit products are various financial products offered by banks to manage deposited funds, including savings accounts, fixed deposits, and recurring deposits.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bank">
  <data key="d0">Bank</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The financial institution that offers deposit products such as Demand Deposits and Time Deposits, and manages account opening and operations.&lt;SEP&gt;An entity that offers various banking products and services to customers, including debit cards, mobile banking, and access to ATM networks.&lt;SEP&gt;The Bank provides banking services, including the management of deposit accounts for customers. It has policies to assist various categories of account holders, including minors and senior citizens.&lt;SEP&gt;A financial institution that manages deposits, provides loans, and offers interest on deposits in various accounts.&lt;SEP&gt;The financial institution that manages term deposits and is responsible for paying interest and handling the terms associated with deceased depositors.&lt;SEP&gt;The bank provides various financial services including account management, customer support, and public awareness campaigns regarding account activation and unclaimed deposits.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="RBI">
  <data key="d0">RBI</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Reserve Bank of India, which sets guidelines for various banking operations including the management of deposit accounts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Demand Deposits">
  <data key="d0">Demand Deposits</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A category of deposits that are withdrawable on demand, including Savings Accounts and Current Accounts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Time Deposits">
  <data key="d0">Time Deposits</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A category of deposits that are received by the Bank for a fixed period, including deposits such as Recurring, Short Term, and Fixed Deposits.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Savings Account">
  <data key="d0">Savings Account</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A type of Demand Deposit with restrictions on the number and amount of withdrawals allowed.&lt;SEP&gt;A deposit account held at the Bank that allows individuals to earn interest while maintaining liquidity.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Current Account">
  <data key="d0">Current Account</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A type of Demand Deposit allowing unlimited withdrawals based on the account balance and agreed limits.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of bank account offered by the Bank primarily for businesses with features suited for frequent transactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Basic Savings Bank Deposit Account">
  <data key="d0">Basic Savings Bank Deposit Account</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A specific type of Savings Account offered according to guidelines laid down by the RBI.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="KYC">
  <data key="d0">KYC</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Know Your Customer, guidelines issued by the RBI that require due diligence in verifying the identity and background of deposit account applicants.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="PAN">
  <data key="d0">PAN</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Permanent Account Number, details required under KYC norms for identity verification of non-individual customers.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Minimum Balance Requirements">
  <data key="d0">Minimum Balance Requirements</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Stipulated minimum or average balances that must be maintained in accounts like Savings and Current Accounts, with penalties for non-compliance.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cash Credit">
  <data key="d0">Cash Credit</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A type of credit facility provided by banks, which borrowers may avail of, impacting the opening of current accounts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Overdraft">
  <data key="d0">Overdraft</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A financial arrangement that allows an individual or business to withdraw more money than is available in their account, affecting current account regulations.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Limited Liability Partnership">
  <data key="d0">Limited Liability Partnership</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A business structure that combines characteristics of partnerships and corporations, which can open current and term deposit accounts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="HUF">
  <data key="d0">HUF</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Hindu Undivided Family, a legal term in India representing a family unit that can operate a bank account.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Specified Associates">
  <data key="d0">Specified Associates</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A term referring to certain entities or individuals specified by the Bank that can open accounts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Debit Card">
  <data key="d0">Debit Card</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A financial tool issued by the Bank to customers with Saving or Current Accounts that allows for electronic transactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mobile Banking">
  <data key="d0">Mobile Banking</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A service provided by the Bank that allows customers to conduct banking transactions via mobile devices.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="WhatsApp Banking">
  <data key="d0">WhatsApp Banking</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A service offered by the Bank enabling customers to utilize banking features through the WhatsApp platform.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Internet Banking">
  <data key="d0">Internet Banking</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">An online platform provided by the Bank for customers to manage their banking activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ATM Network">
  <data key="d0">ATM Network</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">A system of Automated Teller Machines that allow customers access to cash and banking services from different banks.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="NEFT">
  <data key="d0">NEFT</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">National Electronic Funds Transfer, a payment method allowing the transfer of funds between banks in India.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="RTGS">
  <data key="d0">RTGS</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Real Time Gross Settlement, a real-time payment system for high-value transactions between banks.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Statement of Account">
  <data key="d0">Statement of Account</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A periodic statement provided by the Bank detailing the transactions and balance of an individual's account.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Joint Account">
  <data key="d0">Joint Account</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A bank account held by two or more individuals, allowing them to operate the account collectively.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Power of Attorney">
  <data key="d0">Power of Attorney</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">A legal document allowing a person to act on behalf of another in financial or legal matters regarding bank accounts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Nomination">
  <data key="d0">Nomination</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">A provision allowing an account holder to designate someone to inherit the account after the holder's death.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Depositor">
  <data key="d0">Depositor</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">The individual who opens and maintains a deposit account at the Bank.&lt;SEP&gt;The individual who opens a term deposit with the bank and whose death may affect the terms of interest payments on the deposit.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual who holds an account with the bank and can claim balances from inoperative accounts or unclaimed deposits.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Nominee">
  <data key="d0">Nominee</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">The individual designated to receive the balance in the deposit account in the event of the depositor's death, particularly relevant when the nominee is a minor.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual designated to receive benefits from the term deposit in the event of the death of the depositor.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual designated by the depositor to claim the account balance in the event of the depositor's death.&lt;SEP&gt;A nominee is a person designated to receive the benefits or assets in the event of the account holder's death.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Appointee">
  <data key="d0">Appointee</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">An adult person named by the depositor to receive the deposit amount on behalf of a minor nominee.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Resident Indian Senior Citizens">
  <data key="d0">Resident Indian Senior Citizens</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Indian citizens above the age of 60 who may receive higher interest rates on fixed deposits.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Illiterate Person">
  <data key="d0">Illiterate Person</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Individuals who may open deposit accounts at the Bank, under certain conditions, ensuring that their interests are safeguarded.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Visually Challenged Persons">
  <data key="d0">Visually Challenged Persons</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Individuals with visual impairments who are eligible to open and operate bank accounts with specific accommodations provided by the Bank.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Persons with Autism">
  <data key="d0">Persons with Autism</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Individuals covered under the National Trust for the Welfare of Persons with Autism, who can have accounts opened in their name by a guardian.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787380002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Guardian">
  <data key="d0">Guardian</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">An individual appointed to care for persons with disabilities, responsible for managing their accounts.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
