  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A legislation enacted in India aimed at promoting the welfare of persons with disabilities, allowing guardians to open savings bank and term deposits in the name of those covered by the Act.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-004</data>
