  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Indian legislation that allows guardians appointed by District Courts or Collectors to open savings bank and term deposits for individuals covered under the Act.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-004</data>
