  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Unclaimed deposits refer to bank accounts that have not had any activity for a significant period (usually ten years) and are subsequently transferred to the Reserve Bank of India.&lt;SEP&gt;Funds in an account that have not been accessed or claimed by the depositor or their nominees for a certain period.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-008</data>
