<edge source="NRO Deposits" target="Scheduled Commercial Banks">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Scheduled Commercial Banks provide NRO deposits for non-resident ordinary banking needs of Indian citizens living abroad.</data>
